    Encoding LLM:
        1.  Encoding LLM has nothing to do with Regressive LLM.
        2.  It's been used just to help us with the fuzzy search. We are just use it to turn the questions into vectors
            and we have used the same encoder to turn all of this data into vectrs as well.
        3.  We are using this trick to pluck out the relevant information and that's what being sent to regressive LLM.
            The relevant content not necessarily have the same words but have the same meaning.